  "instance_name": "goat_pun",
  "label": "Pun on the word 'goat'",
  "description": "The joke relies on the double meaning of 'goat' — a male goat (a biological animal) and slang for a desirable or attractive person (often used in a sexual context). The humor comes from the absurdity of applying a biological impossibility (dogs and goats cannot reproduce) to a human social stereotype (a 'goat' as a desirable person).",
